q\ge \frac{m}{2}\ge \frac{\mu^{1/t}}{8e}.
\]
Consequently,
\[
e^{-tq/2}
\le
\exp\!\left(-\frac{t}{8e}\,\mu^{1/t}\right).
\]
This proves the claimed tail bound.
